File: src/fit_field_base.cpp
Function: FieldBase::IsSignedInteger
One decode of the test corpus takes about 359.528 ms.
The code below currently runs at 1 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 1.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_BOOL FieldBase::IsSignedInteger(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    switch (GetType(subFieldIndex)) {
        case FIT_BASE_TYPE_SINT8:
        case FIT_BASE_TYPE_SINT16:
        case FIT_BASE_TYPE_SINT32:
            return FIT_TRUE;

        default:
            return FIT_FALSE;
    }
}
```
